   "widgets_values": [
    "## Photo to cartoon\n\n1. Load your photo in **Load Image**.\n2. In the top **CLIP Text Encode**, replace the description after *cartoon illustration of* with your subject: hair (or bald), skin tone, facial hair, glasses, clothing. Add extras the same way, e.g. *with a lime-green polka-dot bow tie*.\n3. Run.\n\nDenoise 0.83 gives a true cartoon. The model keeps only the features you describe, so describe them. Below about 0.8 the result stays close to the photo."
